# CANDE .cid files are CRLF, and the round-trip guarantee this project rests on
# is defined in *bytes* (invariant 1 in CLAUDE.md).  Git must never normalise
# them: a clone with core.autocrlf=true -- the default on many Windows installs
# -- would otherwise rewrite the line endings on checkout and fail every
# fidelity test, for reasons that would look nothing like the cause.
*.cid -text
